---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout title="Resolve Your Past - MPDC Action Guide">
    <div class="resource-container">
        <div class="content-box">
            <header class="resource-header">
                <span class="eyebrow">MPDC Action Guide</span>
                <h1>Worksheet to Resolve Your Past</h1>
                <p class="lead">Replaying the past after divorce gets you nowhere and it keeps you stuck. Use this framework to learn from your thought loops instead of staying trapped inside them.</p>
            </header>

            <section class="module-intro">
                <div class="alert-box">
                    <p><strong>Note:</strong> We recommend listening to the <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1geLDm6BKUZjYDWi93RmUu2fRWsZ00JDE/view" target="_blank">Hypnosis Audio</a> before starting this worksheet.</p>
                </div>
                <p>There are three main things to look at when resolving the past:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Thought Loops:</strong> Repeated mental patterns that never reach a conclusion.</li>
                    <li><strong>Negative Emotions:</strong> Feelings like guilt, anger, or shame that feel "on loop."</li>
                    <li><strong>Limiting Beliefs:</strong> Decisions you made about yourself (e.g. "I'm not enough").</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="worksheet-body">
                <div class="step">
                    <h3>Step 1: Identify the Priority</h3>
                    <p>Think about what is bothering you the most right now. Is it a loop, an emotion, or a belief? Identify it below.</p>
                    <div class="input-line"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="step">
                    <h3>Step 2: Define the Specific Problem</h3>
                    <p>Ask yourself: <em>"What is the actual problem here?"</em> Be specific.</p>
                    <div class="input-line"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="step">
                    <h3>Step 3: Resolve & Learn</h3>
                    <p>Ask yourself these three critical questions to shift your state:</p>
                    
                    <div class="question-block">
                        <label>1. When did you decide to create this problem?</label>
                        <p class="sub-text">Look back to the origin of this feeling or belief.</p>
                        <div class="input-line"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question-block">
                        <label>2. What can you learn from this to let it go?</label>
                        <p class="sub-text">A professional learning is <strong>Positive</strong>, <strong>About You</strong>, and <strong>Future-Based</strong>.</p>
                        <div class="learning-example">
                            <span class="bad">❌ "I don’t have to be scared anymore."</span>
                            <span class="good">✅ "I have the confidence to accomplish anything."</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="input-area"></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="question-block">
                        <label>3. What do you want to do or feel instead?</label>
                        <div class="input-line"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>

<style>
    .resource-container {
        padding: 4rem 1rem;
        background-color: #f8fafc;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
    }

    .content-box {
        max-width: 800px;
        width: 100%;
        background: white;
        padding: 4rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }

    .resource-header {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #C4613A;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        color: #0b3b36;
        margin: 1rem 0;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .lead {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        color: #64748b;
        line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .alert-box {
        background: #f0fdf4;
        border-left: 4px solid #0b3b36;
        padding: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
    }

    .alert-box strong { color: #0b3b36; }

    h3 {
        color: #0b3b36;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;
        padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .step {
        margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .question-block {
        margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    label {
        font-weight: 700;
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        color: #1e293b;
    }

    .sub-text {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #64748b;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .input-line {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        height: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .input-area {
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        height: 6rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        background: #f8fafc;
    }

    .learning-example {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .bad { color: #ef4444; }
    .good { color: #10b981; font-weight: 600; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .content-box {
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
    }
</style>
